a. increase the productivity of girls; b. develop the potential of girls; c. prevent pregnancy at too young an age;
d. reduce maternal and infant mortality rates;
e. reduce poverty rates; and
f. prevent the occurrence of domestic violence. Article 124 Fulfillment of children's rights to exclusive breastfeeding as referred to in Article 123 letter b aims to:
